# Prada L’Homme EDT — Post-XHIGH Rebuild v3
## Whole-formula modeled OAV(t) screen — 2026-08-08

**Formula basis:** 79 target active/product-equivalent rows, 1000 parts total; nominal finished product 15% w/w perfume concentrate.

**Status:** SCREENING MODEL ONLY. Strict empirical OAV is unavailable because no measured formula headspace exists. OAV here is modeled gas-phase concentration divided by an air odor-threshold input. It is not exact intensity, percent contribution, similarity, liking, or release status.

### Model
- Main scenario: 32 °C skin-temperature sensitivity screen.
- Comparison scenario: 25 °C room-temperature screen (included in CSV).
- Initial liquid composition follows the active/product-equivalent target formula.
- Vapor pressure is temperature-adjusted; remaining-film composition is evolved with the project one-compartment first-order screen `n_i(t)=n_i(0) exp[-10 P_i(T)/MW_i * t]`.
- Headspace is ideal-film Raoult screening: `p_i=x_i P_i(T)` and `C_air=p_i MW_i/(RT)`.
- No fitted activity coefficient, skin partition coefficient, ventilation factor, or measured headspace calibration is asserted.

### Internet-verified corrections applied
- Linalool OT 3.2 ng/L air; linalyl acetate OT 110.9 ng/L air (Elsharif, Banerjee & Buettner, 2015).
- Geraniol OT 14 ng/L air; nerol OT 60 ng/L air (Elsharif & Buettner, 2018).
- β-Citronellol OT 10 ng/L air (Elsharif et al., 2017).
- cis-3-Hexenol human gas-phase threshold 19 ppb in argon (Cain et al., 1987); this replaces the stale 0.01-ppb local value.
- Helional ODT 0.14 ppb from direct psychophysical gas-phase work.
- HEDIONE® VP 0.00071 Pa at 20 °C; HABANOLIDE® VP 0.00003 Pa at 20 °C; ROMANDOLIDE® VP 0.00074 Pa at 20 °C; EXALTOLIDE® VP 0.00003 Pa at 20 °C (manufacturer data).
- ISO E SUPER® VP 0.001735 mmHg at 23 °C; CASHMERAN® VP 0.009316 mmHg at 23 °C (IFF).
- VETIVAL manufacturer threshold is 0.1000 µg/L air = 100 ng/L, not 0.1 ppb.
- Styrallyl acetate identity is 1-phenylethyl acetate, CAS 93-92-5; numeric ODT remains a proxy.
- Lemonile has public identity/VP support but no defensible direct public air ODT located; numeric OAV uses a clearly labeled 0.5-ppb screening proxy.

